From: CEB-GNRD platform <ceb-gnrd@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] ftgmac100: add opt-in RTL8211FS and Intel NC-SI test profiles

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD software test model]

Expose the board PHY at MDIO address 2 and retain Realtek vendor pages.
Model two Intel NC-SI channels at the MAC boundary, independently of
libslirp's stateless responder. Defer and bound replies, implement filters,
Intel OEM MAC discovery and link/configuration AENs. Drive NIC power from
the simulated host, independently of the browser panel or BMC resets.

